# Primary best-practical LR-SPLiT-seq core configuration
# Canonical, unexpanded whitelists; ambiguity follows splitcode's native first-hit behavior.
# Structural linker/barcode adjacency matches the LR core geometry.
# BC3 entries are exact-match initiators so a random Hamming-neighbor hit cannot
# consume splitcode's single forward chain before the true cassette is reached.
